{"seq":1,"slug":"single-dish","title":"单天线原理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/radio-astronomy/telescopes/single-dish","wordCount":1614,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"单天线原理\">单天线原理</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>一口抛物面大锅怎样把弥漫整个天空的微弱射电波聚成一个可测的信号？这是单天线射电望远镜的全部魔法所在。它和光学望远镜共享同一套衍射光学骨架，却被两个事实彻底改写了设计：射电波长比可见光长百万倍，所以要达到同样的角分辨率，口径必须巨大；而射电信号又微弱到极致，所以每一分集光面积、每一分表面精度都要锱铢必较。理解单天线，是理解后面<a href=\"receivers-noise\">接收机与噪声</a>和<a href=\"feeds-aperture\">馈源与口径效率</a>的基座，也是理解为什么人们最终要走向<a href=\"../interferometry/interferometry-principles\">干涉测量原理</a>的起点。</p>\n<p>单天线的核心指标有三个：角分辨率（能分开多近的两个源）、增益/有效面积（能聚多少能量）、波束方向图（对不同方向的灵敏度分布）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[入射平面波] --&gt; B[抛物面主反射]&#10;  B --&gt; C[焦点馈源接收]&#10;  C --&gt; D[低噪声放大]&#10;  A --&gt; E[衍射决定波束]&#10;  E --&gt; F[主瓣&lt;br/&gt;HPBW约λ/D]&#10;  E --&gt; G[旁瓣&lt;br/&gt;泄漏与污染]&#10;  B --&gt; H[表面精度&lt;br/&gt;Ruze方程]&#10;  H --&gt; I[高频增益损失]&#10;  F --&gt; J[角分辨率]\">flowchart TD\n  A[入射平面波] --&gt; B[抛物面主反射]\n  B --&gt; C[焦点馈源接收]\n  C --&gt; D[低噪声放大]\n  A --&gt; E[衍射决定波束]\n  E --&gt; F[主瓣&lt;br/&gt;HPBW约λ/D]\n  E --&gt; G[旁瓣&lt;br/&gt;泄漏与污染]\n  B --&gt; H[表面精度&lt;br/&gt;Ruze方程]\n  H --&gt; I[高频增益损失]\n  F --&gt; J[角分辨率]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>公式/关系</th>\n<th>物理含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>角分辨率</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>1.22</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi>λ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta \\approx 1.22\\,\\lambda/D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.22</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>越大口径、越短波长越锐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>有效面积</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>π</mi><msup><mi>D</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_e = \\eta_A \\cdot \\frac{\\pi D^2}{4}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3629em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0179em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8913em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.931em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>实际集光能力</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>增益</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>π</mi><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msup><mi>λ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G = 4\\pi A_e/\\lambda^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>定向聚束能力</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>波束立体角</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>λ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>e</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Omega_A = \\lambda^2/A_e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Ω</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>波束覆盖的天区</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"衍射极限与角分辨率\">衍射极限与角分辨率</h2><p>射电望远镜的&quot;看清能力&quot;被衍射死死锁住。一个直径 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 的圆形口径，其主波束的半功率宽度（HPBW）约为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>1.22</mn><mtext> </mtext><mfrac><mi>λ</mi><mi>D</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta \\approx 1.22\\,\\frac{\\lambda}{D}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0574em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.22</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>代入数字就触目惊心：一台 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D=100</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span></span></span></span></span> 米的巨型单天线，在 21 厘米波长下分辨率只有约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>0.15</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.15^\\circ</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6741em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6741em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∘</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>——比满月还大十几倍。这正是单天线的根本困境：哪怕造到地球极限尺寸，单口径的分辨率也远不及一台业余光学望远镜。这个困境直接催生了<a href=\"../interferometry/interferometry-principles\">干涉测量原理</a>：用相距很远的多台天线合成等效巨大口径。</p>\n<p>但单天线并非无用武之地：它视场大、对大尺度弥散结构敏感（干涉仪反而会&quot;分辨掉&quot;弥散结构），且灵敏度由总集光面积决定，因此巡天、谱线、脉冲星搜寻仍是它的主场——FAST 这台 500 米单天线正是凭超大集光面积成为脉冲星与 <a href=\"../science/pulsars-frbs\">FRB</a> 搜寻利器。</p>\n<h2 id=\"波束方向图-主瓣与旁瓣\">波束方向图：主瓣与旁瓣</h2><p>天线对不同方向的响应不是一个干净的圆斑，而是一个由衍射决定的方向图：中央是主瓣（我们想要的&quot;视线&quot;），周围环绕着一圈圈旁瓣。旁瓣是泄漏通道——一颗强源即使落在旁瓣里，也会把能量漏进数据，污染对主瓣方向的测量。太阳、银河系平面这类强源常通过旁瓣&quot;远程作案&quot;。</p>\n<p>方向图的傅里叶本质很优雅：远场方向图是口径上电场分布的傅里叶变换。这意味着可以通过&quot;锥削&quot;口径照明（让边缘照明渐弱）来压低旁瓣，代价是主瓣变宽、有效面积下降——这正是<a href=\"feeds-aperture\">馈源与口径效率</a>里照明效率与扩散效率权衡的来源。</p>\n<h2 id=\"表面精度与-ruze-方程\">表面精度与 Ruze 方程</h2><p>抛物面之所以能聚焦，靠的是各点反射波到焦点的光程相等。一旦面板有偏差，相位就乱，能量就散。表面均方根误差 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span> 对增益的影响由 Ruze 方程给出：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>G</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mtext> </mtext><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mo>−</mo><msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>π</mi><mi>ε</mi></mrow><mi>λ</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G = G_0\\,\\exp\\!\\left[-\\left(\\frac{4\\pi\\varepsilon}{\\lambda}\\right)^2\\right]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3em;vertical-align:-1.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">exp</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">[</span></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.654em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.9029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">]</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这是一条残酷的指数律：误差相对波长越大，增益掉得越快。当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi><mo>≈</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>16</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon \\approx \\lambda/16</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4831em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mord\">/16</span></span></span></span></span> 时增益已损失约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mtext> </mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1\\,</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span></span></span></span></span>dB。它解释了一个关键工程事实——同一口天线，在长波段表现优异，到毫米波就因表面误差迅速失效。要做毫米波（如 ALMA 的 12 米天线），面板精度必须做到几十微米级。</p>\n<p>对超大天线，重力会让面板随指向角变形，于是现代设计采用&quot;保形&quot;结构或主动面：用作动器实时调整面板，把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span> 压在限度内。这套对表面相位的执着，与<a href=\"feeds-aperture\">馈源与口径效率</a>对照明相位的执着，共同构成了&quot;把口径用满&quot;的工程内核。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>波长</th>\n<th>容许 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>16</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda/16</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mord\">/16</span></span></span></span></span>）</th>\n<th>工程难度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>21 cm</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∼</mo><mn>13</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sim 13</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">13</span></span></span></span></span> mm</td>\n<td>易</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1 cm</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∼</mo><mn>0.6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sim 0.6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.6</span></span></span></span></span> mm</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3 mm</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∼</mo><mn>0.2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sim 0.2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.2</span></span></span></span></span> mm</td>\n<td>难</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1 mm</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∼</mo><mn>60</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sim 60\\ \\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">60</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span>m</td>\n<td>极难</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"单天线与干涉阵列的分工\">单天线与干涉阵列的分工</h2><p>分辨率上单天线远逊，但射电观测远不止&quot;看清&quot;一件事，这决定了单天线与<a href=\"../interferometry/interferometry-principles\">干涉阵列</a>是互补而非替代的关系。核心区别在于两者对空间尺度的敏感区间不同：干涉仪由最长基线给出锐利分辨率、由最短基线设定可测的最大角尺度，比最短基线更大的弥散结构会被&quot;分辨掉&quot;、在图中消失；单天线则因视场大、对大尺度结构天然敏感，反而擅长捕捉这类弥漫辐射。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>观测目标</th>\n<th>更适合的手段</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>大尺度弥散结构</td>\n<td>单天线</td>\n<td>干涉仪会丢失大角尺度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高分辨率精细结构</td>\n<td>干涉阵列</td>\n<td>靠长基线合成等效大口径</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>广域巡天/谱线扫描</td>\n<td>单天线</td>\n<td>大视场 + 总集光面积决定灵敏度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>脉冲星/FRB 搜寻</td>\n<td>大单天线</td>\n<td>吃集光面积，不需高分辨率</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这套分工也解释了为什么现代射电天文往往把两者并用：先用单天线（或阵列的紧密构型）锁定大尺度流量，再用长基线阵列补上细节，最后在成像阶段把两者数据拼接起来——单天线与干涉仪各补对方的短板。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>单天线的角分辨率受衍射锁定在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>1.22</mn><mi>λ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta\\approx 1.22\\lambda/D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.22</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span>，由于射电波长极长，单口径分辨率天然很差，这直接催生了<a href=\"../interferometry/interferometry-principles\">干涉测量</a>。</li>\n<li>波束方向图含主瓣与旁瓣，旁瓣是强源污染的泄漏通道；方向图是口径照明的傅里叶变换，可通过照明锥削权衡旁瓣与效率。</li>\n<li>表面精度由 Ruze 方程支配，增益随 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>ε</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>λ</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(\\varepsilon/\\lambda)^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 指数衰减，决定了一口天线的最高可用频率；毫米波天线需微米级面板与主动面。</li>\n<li>单天线的长处在大视场、大集光面积与对弥散结构的敏感，是巡天、谱线与<a href=\"../science/pulsars-frbs\">脉冲星/FRB</a>搜寻的主力，其效率细节见<a href=\"feeds-aperture\">馈源与口径效率</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"单天线原理","id":"单天线原理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"衍射极限与角分辨率","id":"衍射极限与角分辨率"},{"level":2,"text":"波束方向图：主瓣与旁瓣","id":"波束方向图-主瓣与旁瓣"},{"level":2,"text":"表面精度与 Ruze 方程","id":"表面精度与-ruze-方程"},{"level":2,"text":"单天线与干涉阵列的分工","id":"单天线与干涉阵列的分工"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"大气与射电窗口","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/radio-astronomy/foundations/atmosphere-windows"},"next":{"title":"接收机与噪声","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/radio-astronomy/telescopes/receivers-noise"}}